# exchange_db.py (2026-10-31) from air12_sp_complete.chem (rewritten in place): detailed-balance exchange energies.
#   E: Er = -dE0 (0 K reaction energy, NASA CEA); F: Er = +dE0, Ea field = backward barrier E_b = max(0, Ea_f - dE0),
#   applied as exp(-E_b/kT) by react_tce.cpp EXCHANGEPARTITION (needs the 2026-10-31 build). C3 reactions unchanged.
# NO + O --> N + O2        dE0   +16028 K (E Er was   +19447), F O2 + N --> NO + O        E_b    3420 K
# N2 + O --> NO + N        dE0   +37861 K (E Er was   +38402), F NO + N --> N2 + O        E_b     541 K
# CO + O --> C + O2        dE0   +69544 K (E Er was   +69445), F C + O2 --> CO + O        E_b       0 K  [Ea_f - dE0 = -344 K < 0: clamped]
# CO + C --> C2 + O        dE0   +56744 K (E Er was   +58485), F C2 + O --> CO + C        E_b    1256 K
# CO + N --> CN + O        dE0   +39111 K (E Er was   +39286), F CN + O --> CO + N        E_b       0 K  [Ea_f - dE0 = -511 K < 0: clamped]
# N2 + C --> CN + N        dE0   +23456 K (E Er was   +23676), F CN + N --> N2 + C        E_b       0 K  [Ea_f - dE0 = -256 K < 0: clamped]
# CN + O --> NO + C        dE0   +14406 K (E Er was   +14052), F NO + C --> CN + O        E_b     194 K
# CN + C --> C2 + N        dE0   +17634 K (E Er was   +19198), F C2 + N --> CN + C        E_b       0 K  [Ea_f - dE0 = -4634 K < 0: clamped]
# CO2 + O --> O2 + CO      dE0    +3914 K (E Er was    +3895), F O2 + CO --> CO2 + O      E_b   23878 K
# 12-species air-carbon chemistry: complete reaction set
# Includes all reactions required for conservation of mass/energy.
# Rates from Park (1993) / Alba (2015); per-M Af values derived from
# base rates × enhanced-dissociation multipliers in 12species_air_carbon.chem.
# Format: [Type] [Class] [DoF] [Ea J] [Af m^3/s] [eta] [Er J]
# Types: D=DISSOCIATION, S=RECOMBINATIONPARTITION, E=EXCHANGE, F=EXCHANGEPARTITION
#
# DoF = 1.0 for atom M (no internal energy), 2.0 for molecule M (rotational DoF)
# Af atom   = base_C * atom_mult   * 1e-6 / NA
# Af molecule = base_C * mol_mult  * 1e-6 / NA  (mol_mult=1.0 for all diss here)

# ── N2 dissociation / recombination ──────────────────────────────────────────
# Park base: C=7.0e21, n=-1.60, Td=113200 K (Ea=1.563E-18 J)
# Atom multiplier (N,O,C): 4.286 -> Af=4.982E-08; Molecule multiplier: 1.0 -> Af=1.162E-08
N2 + C --> N + N + C
D A 1.0 1.563E-18 4.982E-08 -1.60 -1.563E-18
N + N --> N2 + C
S A 0.0 0.000E+00 4.982E-08 -1.60  1.563E-18

N2 + N --> N + N + N
D A 1.0 1.563E-18 4.982E-08 -1.60 -1.563E-18
N + N --> N2 + N
S A 0.0 0.000E+00 4.982E-08 -1.60  1.563E-18

N2 + O --> N + N + O
D A 1.0 1.563E-18 4.982E-08 -1.60 -1.563E-18
N + N --> N2 + O
S A 0.0 0.000E+00 4.982E-08 -1.60  1.563E-18

N2 + C2 --> N + N + C2
D A 2.0 1.563E-18 1.162E-08 -1.60 -1.563E-18
N + N --> N2 + C2
S A 0.0 0.000E+00 1.162E-08 -1.60  1.563E-18

N2 + C3 --> N + N + C3
D A 2.0 1.563E-18 1.162E-08 -1.60 -1.563E-18
N + N --> N2 + C3
S A 0.0 0.000E+00 1.162E-08 -1.60  1.563E-18

N2 + CN --> N + N + CN
D A 2.0 1.563E-18 1.162E-08 -1.60 -1.563E-18
N + N --> N2 + CN
S A 0.0 0.000E+00 1.162E-08 -1.60  1.563E-18

N2 + CO --> N + N + CO
D A 2.0 1.563E-18 1.162E-08 -1.60 -1.563E-18
N + N --> N2 + CO
S A 0.0 0.000E+00 1.162E-08 -1.60  1.563E-18

N2 + CO2 --> N + N + CO2
D A 2.0 1.563E-18 1.162E-08 -1.60 -1.563E-18
N + N --> N2 + CO2
S A 0.0 0.000E+00 1.162E-08 -1.60  1.563E-18

N2 + N2 --> N + N + N2
D A 2.0 1.563E-18 1.162E-08 -1.60 -1.563E-18
N + N --> N2 + N2
S A 0.0 0.000E+00 1.162E-08 -1.60  1.563E-18

N2 + NO --> N + N + NO
D A 2.0 1.563E-18 1.162E-08 -1.60 -1.563E-18
N + N --> N2 + NO
S A 0.0 0.000E+00 1.162E-08 -1.60  1.563E-18

N2 + O2 --> N + N + O2
D A 2.0 1.563E-18 1.162E-08 -1.60 -1.563E-18
N + N --> N2 + O2
S A 0.0 0.000E+00 1.162E-08 -1.60  1.563E-18

