# ── NO dissociation / recombination ──────────────────────────────────────────
# Park base: C=5.0e15, n=0.00, Td=75500 K (Ea=1.042E-18 J)
# High-rate M (N,O,NO,C): mult=22 -> Af=1.827E-13; Molecule M (N2,O2): mult=1.0 -> Af=8.303E-15
# Note: reference multipliers (line 79) give C2,C3,CO2,CO,CN mult=1.0 (same as N2,O2)
# NO + M -> N + O + M and N + O -> NO + M (2026-10-27, user): A from Tsang & Herron 1991, J. Phys. Chem. Ref. Data 20, 609
#   (NO + Ar: 1.6e-9 exp(-74,700/T) cm^3/molecule/s = 1.6e-15 m^3/s, factor-2 uncertainty; x1.5 N2, x2.5 CO2): 1.6e-15 for
#   M = N, O, C; 2.4e-15 (x1.5) for diatomic M; 4.0e-15 (x2.5) for CO2, C3. Was Park 1993 1.827e-13 (M = N, O, NO, C; x22,
#   not supported by measurement or by QCT: Jo et al. arXiv 2111.01751 find Park ~100x too large) / 8.303e-15 (others).
#   Ea kept at 1.042e-18 J (75,470 K = endothermicity; a lower Ea triggers the max(Ea,-Er) threshold). notes/no-dissociation-rate.md
NO + C --> N + O + C
D A 1.0 1.042E-18 1.600E-15 0.00 -1.042E-18
N + O --> NO + C
S A 0.0 0.000E+00 1.600E-15 0.00  1.042E-18

NO + N --> N + O + N
D A 1.0 1.042E-18 1.600E-15 0.00 -1.042E-18
N + O --> NO + N
S A 0.0 0.000E+00 1.600E-15 0.00  1.042E-18

NO + NO --> N + O + NO
D A 2.0 1.042E-18 2.400E-15 0.00 -1.042E-18
N + O --> NO + NO
S A 0.0 0.000E+00 2.400E-15 0.00  1.042E-18

NO + O --> N + O + O
D A 1.0 1.042E-18 1.600E-15 0.00 -1.042E-18
N + O --> NO + O
S A 0.0 0.000E+00 1.600E-15 0.00  1.042E-18

NO + C2 --> N + O + C2
D A 2.0 1.042E-18 2.400E-15 0.00 -1.042E-18
N + O --> NO + C2
S A 0.0 0.000E+00 2.400E-15 0.00  1.042E-18

NO + C3 --> N + O + C3
D A 2.0 1.042E-18 4.000E-15 0.00 -1.042E-18
N + O --> NO + C3
S A 0.0 0.000E+00 4.000E-15 0.00  1.042E-18

NO + CN --> N + O + CN
D A 2.0 1.042E-18 2.400E-15 0.00 -1.042E-18
N + O --> NO + CN
S A 0.0 0.000E+00 2.400E-15 0.00  1.042E-18

NO + CO --> N + O + CO
D A 2.0 1.042E-18 2.400E-15 0.00 -1.042E-18
N + O --> NO + CO
S A 0.0 0.000E+00 2.400E-15 0.00  1.042E-18

NO + CO2 --> N + O + CO2
D A 2.0 1.042E-18 4.000E-15 0.00 -1.042E-18
N + O --> NO + CO2
S A 0.0 0.000E+00 4.000E-15 0.00  1.042E-18

NO + N2 --> N + O + N2
D A 2.0 1.042E-18 2.400E-15 0.00 -1.042E-18
N + O --> NO + N2
S A 0.0 0.000E+00 2.400E-15 0.00  1.042E-18

NO + O2 --> N + O + O2
D A 2.0 1.042E-18 2.400E-15 0.00 -1.042E-18
N + O --> NO + O2
S A 0.0 0.000E+00 2.400E-15 0.00  1.042E-18

